1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,240
-Cheers!
-Come on.

3
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:56,960
Mengmeng.

4
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,840
Do you remember our promise?

5
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,200
We said

6
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:04,360
if neither of us found someone we loved,

7
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:06,000
I'd run a tavern,

8
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,200
and you'd teach at a girls' school.

9
00:02:10,040 --> 00:02:11,680
When we grew old,

10
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:13,680
we'd keep each other company
and never be lonely.

11
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,960
Who would've thought

12
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,280
you'd be getting married?

13
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,840
Looks like fate has been kind to us.

14
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:28,120
Zhili has Anian,

15
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,440
I have His Majesty,

16
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,760
and you have Young Lord Shen.

17
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:34,560
Another toast.

18
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,960
Cheers.

19
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,360
Mengmeng.

20
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,960
Ever since we came back
from the hot springs,

21
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,760
you've been acting strange.

22
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,480
Is something bothering you?

23
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,880
If Mengmeng had something on her mind,

24
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,600
wouldn't she tell you?

25
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,480
She must be worried

26
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,240
about tomorrow's wedding.

27
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,600
To wear the phoenix crown,

28
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,880
you must bear its weight.

29
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,400
Becoming mistress of the Central Palace

30
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,760
won't be as carefree
as serving at the Office.

31
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,880
Relax.

32
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,440
No matter how heavy the phoenix crown,

33
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:17,040
all of us will be there
to help you carry it.

34
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,120
Exactly.

35
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,880
His Majesty will protect you at court.

36
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,080
My brother and Anian
will watch over you in the palace.

37
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,360
Fuzhi and I will stay by your side.

38
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:28,400
And Yin Qing will keep you laughing.

39
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,880
The five of us from the Office

40
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,240
will always have your back.

41
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,360
Come.

42
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:38,200
Cheers.

43
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,560
Cheers.

44
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,920
I'm afraid this is all just a dream.

45
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,440
And when I wake up,

46
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,400
it'll all be gone.

47
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,640
Mengmeng.

48
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,760
If they ever wrong you in the palace,

49
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,360
come back to Bofeng Tavern.

50
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,360
This will always be your home.

51
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,480
And I'll always be here for you.

52
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:19,520
I don't care whether you live
in wealth and splendor.

53
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,440
I only wish you

54
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:23,400
joy and good health, year after year.

55
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,360
Mengmeng.

56
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:28,320
Whether you're Director Meng of the Office

57
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:30,120
or Her Majesty the Empress
of the Central Palace,

58
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,320
to me,

59
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:34,960
you'll always be the sister
who helped me grow

60
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,040
and kept me safe.

61
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,800
You'll always be

62
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:43,080
the girl I'm proudest of and admire most.

63
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:53,880
All right.

64
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,840
You're getting married tomorrow.

65
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,360
No getting sentimental tonight.

66
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,280
Come.

67
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,120
Let's drink to...

68
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:06,720
-The Empress of Daning!
-The Empress of Daning!

69
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,160
And

70
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,720
to nights when we can still drink like this.

71
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,520
Your Highness.

72
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,840
By this time tomorrow,

73
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,240
every lantern in the capital

74
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,760
will be covered in funeral white.

75
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:52,240
Eight years of blood debt

76
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,600
will finally be repaid.

77
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,440
At the Battle of Humen Pass,

78
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,480
when Ying Gua was still Crown Prince,

79
00:05:57,560 --> 00:06:00,040
that arrow pierced more
than my uncle's throat.

80
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,520
It shattered the fortunes
of my mother's clan.

81
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,240
After that,

82
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,840
Father saw only my elder brother.

83
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,120
What is he?

84
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,520
Just a coward hiding in the royal tent,

85
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,280
playing at schemes and power.

86
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,400
Your Highness.

87
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,200
The time for revenge has come.

88
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,080
Daning's Left Chancellor believes

89
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,640
you came to present warhorses

90
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,120
and secure the marriage alliance.

91
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:28,200
We already have the gate-opening warrant.

92
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,360
Once the signal is given tomorrow,

93
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:33,520
Beijian's Wolf Cavalry assassins

94
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,040
can ride straight into the capital.

95
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:36,600
Yes.

96
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,520
I've kept you waiting, Second Prince.

97
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:49,880
Mr. Shangguan, you leave no trace on snow.

98
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,360
Even Beijian's Wind Listeners

99
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:53,360
couldn't sense your presence.

100
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,840
Truly remarkable.

101
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,800
You're too kind, Second Prince.

102
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,560
More importantly,

103
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:00,920
you should be more concerned
with tomorrow's operation.

104
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,760
At tomorrow's imperial wedding,

105
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,560
the bridal procession must leave the Office

106
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:09,840
and pass along Changle Street.

107
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,560
We've already turned
the commander of its escort.

108
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:16,280
He'll claim he's searching for assassins

109
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,880
and draw away half the Imperial Guard.

110
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,760
The alleys here form a maze.

111
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,960
This is where Ying Gua will die.

112
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,200
Sir,

113
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,320
are you truly certain

114
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,160
this ambush cannot fail?

115
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:31,400
Ying Gua is sly as a fox.

116
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,520
Back then, with only 3,000 light cavalry,

117
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,480
he lured my army of 30,000
into a death trap.

118
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:38,360
If this is another one of his schemes,

119
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:40,680
you and I will be trapped
with nowhere to run.

120
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,320
With our forces working
openly and in secret,

121
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,320
Second Prince, you have nothing to fear.

122
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,240
Your Highness's Wolf Cavalry
will strike head-on.

123
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:48,640
My Blood Moon Society assassins
are already in place

124
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,480
to support the Princess from the shadows.

125
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,920
Even if Ying Gua casts a net
across heaven and earth,

126
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:54,920
this wedding feast

127
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,960
will still be his last meal.

128
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,800
Interesting.

129
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:06,520
But after all this time working with you,

130
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,960
I've never seen your true face.

131
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,160
The day Zhongwan is restored,

132
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,320
this face hidden in dust for ten years

133
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:15,600
will see daylight again.

134
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:18,800
Then, Second Prince,

135
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:21,120
we can drink wine from Ying Gua's skull.

136
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,720
The Hour of the Rooster has passed.

137
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:29,880
Ying Gua's death draws near.

138
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,840
Daning's destiny

139
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:34,440
has run its course too.

140
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,600
This time, I'll do it myself

141
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:48,200
and take Ying Gua's head.

142
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:52,040
The imperial wedding of Emperor and Empress

143
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,480
is a grand rite of state.

144
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,880
We now present these betrothal gifts

145
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:57,040
to show the Son of Heaven's solemn devotion

146
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,640
and honor the Empress's virtue
as mother of the realm.

147
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:02,680
Ten bolts of scarlet silk
with golden phoenix brocade,

148
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,640
one pair of green-jade nuptial cups,

149
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,960
one pair of kingfisher-feather
paired-phoenix vases,

150
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:08,680
one black-glass pearl,

151
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:10,600
one lingzhi-shaped ruyi scepter,

152
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:13,160
and one set of gold-feather
phoenix hairpins.

153
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,360
May dragon and phoenix bless this union.

154
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,320
Will I still get to see you often

155
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,240
after this, Your Majesty?

156
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:19,840
Of course.

157
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,840
I'll always be your Mengmeng.

158
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,760
We promised not to cry today.

159
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:26,160
We're sending Mengmeng off with smiles.

160
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,440
The auspicious hour approaches.

161
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:33,600
We respectfully invite
Her Majesty the Empress.

162
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,840
I never thought those stories in the novels

163
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,680
would actually come true.

164
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:17,600
Shunzi.

165
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:20,320
Go buy me a few more copies
of the Spring and Autumn Annals.

166
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:21,560
Boss, what for?

167
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,480
Obviously, next year

168
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:25,240
I'm going to pass the metropolitan exam too.

169
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,440
Your Highness.

170
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:42,000
The phoenix palanquin has reached the
street.

171
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:44,480
Look.

172
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:45,920
What a sight.

173
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:50,120
Die, Ying Gua.

174
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:58,000
Run!

175
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:09,360
You think stopping me

176
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,680
means this is over?

177
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,400
Back to the hall! Protect His Majesty!

178
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,040
The auspicious hour has arrived.

179
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:27,400
Escort Their Majesties into the hall
to honor the ancestors.

180
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:59,080
Their Majesties, present the incense.

181
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:24,000
First bow: to the Sacred Ancestor
who founded the realm.

182
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,200
Yao'er.

183
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:33,240
Second bow: may the realm endure forever.

184
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:42,400
Third bow: may Emperor and Empress
be of one heart.

185
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,600
Yao'er, kill him.

186
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,320
-The rites are complete.
-Yao'er.

187
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,920
Kill him.

188
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:54,160
Yao'er, kill him.

189
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,880
Yao'er, he destroyed your kingdom.

190
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,560
Kill him.

191
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:00,720
Yao'er.

192
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,840
He destroyed your kingdom.

193
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:04,000
Kill him.

194
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,200
Yao'er.

195
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,680
Kill him.

196
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,200
Your Majesty.

197
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,600
Guards! Protect His Majesty!

198
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,200
Your Majesty.

199
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:35,120
Mengmeng.

200
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,360
What's wrong?

201
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,840
One step closer

202
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:27,960
and your Emperor

203
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:29,560
dies without a burial place.

204
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,920
Enough of your tricks.

205
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,360
Who are you,

206
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:15,920
to attempt regicide in Sacred Ancestor Hall?

207
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,560
More than ten years ago,

208
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,840
a hundred thousand of my people
were slaughtered.

209
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,000
That blood debt...

210
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,000
have you forgotten?

211
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,800
A Zhongwan remnant.

212
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,640
You destroyed our home and nation,

213
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,920
then call us remnants?

214
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,720
Today I'll use the Son of Heaven's blood

215
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:46,520
to honor the dead of Zhongwan.

216
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:48,200
I'll fight you to the death!

217
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,720
Yin Qing?

218
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:57,840
How could it be you?

219
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:07,320
You've hidden behind a mask for so long.

220
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:09,760
At last you show yourself.

221
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:10,680
Did you truly think my palace

222
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:12,400
was somewhere you could come and go
as you please?

223
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:22,360
Mengmeng, you knew already?

224
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,600
Yin Qing, your incense...

225
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,880
I replaced it three days ago.

226
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,920
Today I used myself as bait

227
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:40,400
to draw all of you out.

228
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:42,880
Do you know how long I've waited
for this moment?

229
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:45,920
You joined forces with him to trap us?

230
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:15,160
Reporting to Your Majesty.

231
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:17,640
All nine gates around the hall are sealed.

232
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:20,240
None of them will escape today.

233
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:23,120
Beijian's Second Prince
and his Wolf Cavalry are destroyed.

234
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:25,120
The Blood Moon Society
has no one left to rely on.

235
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:27,680
-Impossible.
-Left Chancellor.

236
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:31,240
You privately issued tribute credentials

237
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:33,320
that allowed Beijian's Second Prince

238
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,640
to ally with the Blood Moon Society

239
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:36,000
and sneak armed men into the capital.

240
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,000
Your Majesty, please hear me.

241
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,120
I must have fallen for a traitor's scheme

242
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:41,200
when I issued those tribute credentials.

243
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:43,440
Your Majesty, what matters most now

244
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:45,360
is exterminating the Zhongwan remnants.

245
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:47,720
Ying Gua.

246
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,600
I came here today

247
00:20:51,360 --> 00:20:53,320
with no intention of leaving alive.

248
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:55,880
Seize him.

249
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:16,720
Yin Qing, stop.

250
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:17,880
Don't cling to this madness.

251
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:19,080
You're the one lost in madness.

252
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:22,120
I endured humiliation and planned every step

253
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:24,080
to raise you above everyone else in Daning.

254
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,760
Kill Ying Gua today,

255
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:28,160
and Zhongwan can be restored.

256
00:21:29,120 --> 00:21:30,160
Restore the kingdom?

257
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:31,880
That would only uproot the people.

258
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:34,160
This blood feud...

259
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:35,080
I would rather not avenge it.

260
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:37,560
Besides,

261
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:40,240
I am now a citizen of Daning.

262
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:44,800
Director Meng is in league
with the Blood Moon Society?

263
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:45,920
-Impossible.
-Impossible.

264
00:21:46,840 --> 00:21:48,800
Seize every remaining member

265
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,160
of the Blood Moon Society.

266
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:52,000
You forced my hand.

267
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:31,600
Look closely.

268
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:35,000
Would you truly let her become
Empress of Daning?

269
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:37,920
The Mystic Bird emblem?

270
00:22:39,600 --> 00:22:42,160
The mark of Zhongwan royalty.

271
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:44,360
You're the Princess of Zhongwan.

272
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:46,840
A Zhongwan princess

273
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:49,840
has been manipulating Daning's court?

274
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:50,880
Guards!

275
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:52,760
Execute her on the spot.

276
00:22:52,840 --> 00:22:54,320
Who dares?

277
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:57,480
Your Majesty.

278
00:22:58,560 --> 00:23:01,560
Did you know her identity all along?

279
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:03,680
Your Majesty.

280
00:23:03,760 --> 00:23:05,520
Are you going to hand Daning

281
00:23:05,600 --> 00:23:08,080
over to the remnants of Zhongwan?

282
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,560
Meng Tinghui previously

283
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:11,760
knew nothing of her birth.

284
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:14,600
But everything she has done for Daning,

285
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:16,760
I know better than anyone.

286
00:23:17,280 --> 00:23:18,800
Stop pretending, Princess.

287
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:21,640
We planned the Infinity Pill disaster
together.

288
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,840
Gu Qin's execution,

289
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:25,720
the collapse of the Beijian
marriage alliance—

290
00:23:25,800 --> 00:23:27,480
all of it was to plunge Daning

291
00:23:27,560 --> 00:23:28,840
into crisis at home and abroad.

292
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:31,600
You think if you cut off
every path she has in Daning

293
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:34,080
and pin every disaster on her,

294
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,920
she'll restore Zhongwan with you?

295
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,640
You keep her beside you

296
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,680
only because you want to use her too.

297
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:41,160
Between you will always stand

298
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,800
the hundred thousand dead of Zhongwan.

299
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,800
You can never be together.

300
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:47,400
Your Majesty, no more words.

301
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:49,600
Execute this witch
and the Zhongwan remnants at once

302
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:51,000
and end the threat forever.

303
00:23:51,080 --> 00:23:53,600
You all keep calling me
a witch who will ruin the realm.

304
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:09,760
Today I'll carve away
this Mystic Bird emblem

305
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:11,600
and show you where my loyalty lies.

306
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:12,560
Don't!

307
00:24:49,840 --> 00:24:52,040
The Mystic Bird emblem is destroyed.

308
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:55,200
I am no longer the Princess of Zhongwan.

309
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:58,280
I am only Meng Tinghui.

310
00:25:44,080 --> 00:25:45,080
Left Chancellor...

311
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:49,720
If you want to harm His Majesty of Daning,

312
00:25:49,800 --> 00:25:52,960
you'll have to step over
Xu Ting's body first.

313
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:07,360
-Left Chancellor.
-Left Chancellor.

314
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:09,520
-Chancellor!
-Left Chancellor, wake up!

315
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:11,080
Fetch the imperial physician!

316
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:12,240
-Quickly!
-Yes!

317
00:26:12,320 --> 00:26:14,200
-Imperial physician...
-Your Majesty.

318
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:21,320
Your Majesty.

319
00:26:23,120 --> 00:26:24,880
I was wrong before.

320
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,600
Please... don't hold it against me.

321
00:26:40,800 --> 00:26:42,200
I...

322
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:46,960
can no longer serve Your Majesty.

323
00:26:47,840 --> 00:26:49,920
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

324
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:51,520
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

325
00:26:56,200 --> 00:27:00,280
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

326
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,440
Chancellor.

327
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:16,360
Princess.

328
00:27:17,280 --> 00:27:18,920
We should be happy.

329
00:27:19,520 --> 00:27:20,480
I avenged you,

330
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:23,080
and my younger sister as well.

331
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:49,600
Kill

332
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:52,280
every last Blood Moon remnant.

333
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:56,560
Xu Ting is dead,

334
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:58,200
and now your heart aches?

335
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:01,960
When Daning's iron cavalry

336
00:29:02,040 --> 00:29:04,400
slaughtered my people of Zhongwan,

337
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:07,480
do you know how it tore my heart apart?

338
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:09,640
You and I,

339
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:11,400
Zhongwan and Daning,

340
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:12,680
can never share the same sky.

341
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:18,280
If this blood feud can never be settled,

342
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:21,440
then today I'll use your life

343
00:29:23,040 --> 00:29:25,520
to end it once and for all.

344
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,280
Sir.

345
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,160
Your Majesty.

346
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,440
Mengmeng.

347
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:03,440
Haven't Daning and Zhongwan
shed enough blood?

348
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:07,600
Your Majesty, please spare Yin Qing.

349
00:30:08,720 --> 00:30:11,160
The hairpin I gave you with my own hands...

350
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:15,320
and you use it to threaten me?

351
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:17,040
I know Your Majesty hates Yin Qing,

352
00:30:18,040 --> 00:30:20,600
but I can't watch him die.

353
00:30:21,880 --> 00:30:23,040
And I can't stand by

354
00:30:23,120 --> 00:30:25,360
while hatred between Daning
and Zhongwan deepens.

355
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:28,200
The Left Chancellor died protecting me.

356
00:30:28,720 --> 00:30:30,520
If I don't kill him today,

357
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:34,080
what right have I to defend the realm
and protect the people?

358
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,240
Today

359
00:30:36,040 --> 00:30:37,400
is the day he dies.

360
00:30:39,400 --> 00:30:40,480
Stop!

361
00:30:41,040 --> 00:30:42,320
I am protecting Yin Qing

362
00:30:43,560 --> 00:30:45,920
for Daning's sake as well.

363
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,960
Your Majesty, Meng Tinghui
has bewitched your heart.

364
00:30:52,040 --> 00:30:54,040
You must not release
the mastermind behind this.

365
00:30:54,120 --> 00:30:55,680
I beg Your Majesty

366
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:57,840
to execute the Princess of Zhongwan
and her followers

367
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:59,040
and bring peace to the realm.

368
00:30:59,120 --> 00:31:00,160
Your Majesty.

369
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:01,720
Spare the tiger, and disaster will follow.

370
00:31:02,560 --> 00:31:03,920
Today we absolutely cannot

371
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:05,800
let them leave Sacred Ancestor Hall.

372
00:31:05,880 --> 00:31:06,720
Anian.

373
00:31:06,800 --> 00:31:08,120
Must you really kill every last one?

374
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:09,120
Your Majesty.

375
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:10,240
We failed to root them out before.

376
00:31:10,320 --> 00:31:11,480
That caused today's calamity.

377
00:31:11,560 --> 00:31:13,000
We must not repeat that mistake.

378
00:31:13,080 --> 00:31:15,560
Zhishu, you know Mengmeng
would never harm His Majesty.

379
00:31:15,640 --> 00:31:17,480
-Please...
-We beg Your Majesty

380
00:31:17,560 --> 00:31:20,640
to execute the Princess of Zhongwan
and her followers

381
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:22,080
and bring peace to the realm.

382
00:32:13,760 --> 00:32:14,880
The phoenix pendant is broken.

383
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:17,280
Our private bond is ended.

384
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:20,680
But I will not yield one inch
of Daning's realm.

385
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:25,480
Let them go.

386
00:32:26,040 --> 00:32:27,440
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

387
00:33:58,800 --> 00:34:00,720
The dragon throne sways,

388
00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:02,800
the witch beguiles,

389
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:05,200
loyal ministers fall,

390
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:07,000
the frontiers burn.

391
00:34:07,080 --> 00:34:08,720
The Emperor is besotted,

392
00:34:08,800 --> 00:34:11,360
the realm withers.

393
00:34:11,440 --> 00:34:13,240
The dragon throne sways,

394
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:15,320
the witch beguiles,

395
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:17,480
loyal ministers fall,

396
00:34:17,560 --> 00:34:19,800
the frontiers burn.

397
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:46,360
Proprietor Yan.

398
00:34:46,440 --> 00:34:49,440
Will Lord Meng really restore Zhongwan
and attack Daning?

399
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:51,760
-Proprietor Yan!
-Boss!

400
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:53,000
Bad news!

401
00:34:53,080 --> 00:34:53,920
War is coming!

402
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,840
My relatives at the border saw enemy troops.

403
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:59,000
Then let's hurry and stockpile grain.

404
00:34:59,080 --> 00:34:59,920
If war really breaks out,

405
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:01,560
grain will be what keeps us alive.

406
00:35:01,640 --> 00:35:02,480
Yes.

407
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:09,720
-Your Majesty.
-Grand Tutor, no need for ceremony.

408
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:11,840
Please sit.

409
00:35:18,120 --> 00:35:19,760
I assume you've already heard

410
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:22,240
that they're calling me a foolish ruler now?

411
00:35:22,320 --> 00:35:23,440
In my view,

412
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:26,920
Your Majesty made the realm your board
and benevolence your bait.

413
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:28,680
That is great wisdom.

414
00:35:28,760 --> 00:35:30,600
Zhishu tells me

415
00:35:30,680 --> 00:35:33,640
Your Majesty intends to issue
a new policy for Zhongwan.

416
00:35:33,720 --> 00:35:36,360
Those who submit will be freed
from slave status and granted farmland.

417
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:38,520
They may enter government
through the examinations.

418
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:40,200
This measure

419
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:42,360
will show Zhongwan's survivors

420
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,800
Daning's sincerity.

421
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:45,120
I'll bear the infamy.

422
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:47,320
But this game for the realm

423
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:49,840
will be played by my rules.

424
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:52,320
Your Majesty means to lead
the campaign personally?

425
00:35:54,240 --> 00:35:56,560
With both chancellorships vacant
and the court unsettled,

426
00:35:56,640 --> 00:35:58,920
and Beijian's wolfish ambitions,

427
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,120
colluding with Zhongwan remnants

428
00:36:00,200 --> 00:36:01,280
to attack Your Majesty,

429
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:02,800
this journey will be perilous.

430
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:03,960
The realm needs a leader.

431
00:36:04,040 --> 00:36:06,040
I asked you here today

432
00:36:06,120 --> 00:36:07,960
precisely to have you hold the court

433
00:36:08,040 --> 00:36:10,120
and oversee the Six Ministries
to keep the court stable.

434
00:36:11,440 --> 00:36:13,800
I let Yin Qing leave
Sacred Ancestor Hall that day

435
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:15,200
not for Meng Tinghui.

436
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:17,400
Yin Qing leads
the Zhongwan survivors.

437
00:36:17,480 --> 00:36:19,560
If we killed him
in Daning's Sacred Ancestor Hall,

438
00:36:19,640 --> 00:36:21,400
it would inflame resentment
among those survivors.

439
00:36:22,080 --> 00:36:23,760
Then Daning would face

440
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:26,040
encirclement by Zhongwan and Beijian.

441
00:36:26,120 --> 00:36:28,040
We must fight Beijian sooner or later.

442
00:36:28,120 --> 00:36:30,560
So we might as well strike first.

443
00:36:31,520 --> 00:36:33,200
Besides, that day Meng Tinghui

444
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:34,640
was gambling with her life too.

445
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:37,960
She was betting I could find a third path,

446
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:39,280
one different from Father's

447
00:36:39,360 --> 00:36:41,200
for resolving the feud
between our two states.

448
00:36:41,960 --> 00:36:44,120
When you taught me the art of kingship,
you said

449
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:45,920
a true ruler of all under Heaven

450
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:47,840
must be broad enough to embrace the realm.

451
00:36:48,760 --> 00:36:49,800
I intend to unite

452
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:51,640
this fractured realm

453
00:36:51,720 --> 00:36:53,520
and give the people
an age of peace and prosperity.

454
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:00,840
Grand Tutor, will you help me

455
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:03,560
play this game?

456
00:37:09,520 --> 00:37:10,600
I once said:

457
00:37:11,240 --> 00:37:12,760
all under Heaven is a chessboard,

458
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:14,240
and the sovereign is the player.

459
00:37:16,040 --> 00:37:16,880
I

460
00:37:18,320 --> 00:37:19,560
am willing to take up this game

461
00:37:20,440 --> 00:37:21,960
for Your Majesty.

462
00:37:26,680 --> 00:37:28,720
I have not attended court in ten years.

463
00:37:30,240 --> 00:37:31,600
I never imagined

464
00:37:33,120 --> 00:37:34,400
I

465
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:36,480
could once again
share Your Majesty's burdens

466
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:40,440
and serve Daning.

467
00:37:40,520 --> 00:37:42,000
With you holding the court,

468
00:37:42,560 --> 00:37:44,600
I can campaign without worry behind me.

469
00:37:45,080 --> 00:37:46,400
From this day forward,

470
00:37:47,080 --> 00:37:48,240
you will govern in my stead,

471
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:50,200
and oversee the Six Ministries.

472
00:37:50,280 --> 00:37:52,760
I will not fail this trust.

473
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,360
I will do all in my power

474
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:57,480
to keep Daning's court secure

475
00:37:57,560 --> 00:37:59,600
and await Your Majesty's triumphant return.

476
00:38:01,040 --> 00:38:01,880
Your Majesty.

477
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:03,480
Yin Qing's group entered old Zhongwan lands
in Qingzhou.

478
00:38:03,560 --> 00:38:05,640
Beijian has massed troops at the border
but has not moved.

479
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:08,400
Yeqi is drilling troops at Qingxia Pass
as a show of force.

480
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:10,120
Taishui cavalry raided
our Jizhou camp at night,

481
00:38:10,200 --> 00:38:11,920
burning three of our army's granaries.

482
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:13,720
War is breaking out everywhere.
We cannot delay.

483
00:38:16,040 --> 00:38:17,800
Daning's forces will advance
on three fronts.

484
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:18,720
Shen Zhishu.

485
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:21,160
Lead your army to Yeqi. Tell its king

486
00:38:21,240 --> 00:38:23,240
whether he will be Daning's enemy or friend

487
00:38:23,320 --> 00:38:24,560
is his choice to weigh.

488
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:27,040
-I obey.
-Di Nian.

489
00:38:27,120 --> 00:38:28,440
Lead an elite force against Taishui.

490
00:38:28,520 --> 00:38:30,400
You must take the city within seven days.

491
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:32,000
I will not fail Your Majesty.

492
00:38:32,080 --> 00:38:32,920
Your Majesty.

493
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:34,440
When the Second Prince's body returns,

494
00:38:34,520 --> 00:38:35,760
Beijian will seize the chance to attack.

495
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:36,920
Then we'd face war on two fronts.

496
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:38,160
No need to wait for Beijian.

497
00:38:38,640 --> 00:38:39,640
Three days from now,

498
00:38:39,720 --> 00:38:41,480
I will personally lead the army
against Beijian.

499
00:38:41,560 --> 00:38:42,760
I'll make them understand

500
00:38:43,360 --> 00:38:45,800
Daning is not theirs to trample at will.

501
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:49,560
I request to serve as the vanguard.

502
00:38:50,200 --> 00:38:52,320
I owe the Left Chancellor a great debt.

503
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:53,960
I must avenge him.

504
00:38:55,120 --> 00:38:56,560
Even if I am shattered to pieces,

505
00:38:56,640 --> 00:38:57,560
I will not hesitate.

506
00:38:58,680 --> 00:38:59,560
Good.

507
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:01,640
Soldiers.

508
00:39:01,720 --> 00:39:03,480
Powerful enemies surround us.

509
00:39:03,560 --> 00:39:05,040
One step back

510
00:39:05,120 --> 00:39:06,600
and our mountains and rivers shatter.

511
00:39:06,680 --> 00:39:07,960
One step forward

512
00:39:08,040 --> 00:39:09,640
and our iron bones forge the walls.

513
00:39:09,720 --> 00:39:12,400
I will live and die with every soldier.

514
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:14,320
Defend our land!

515
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:17,080
Protect our people!

516
00:39:17,160 --> 00:39:18,720
Defend our land!

517
00:39:18,800 --> 00:39:20,600
Protect our people!

518
00:39:20,680 --> 00:39:21,840
Defend our land!

519
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:23,720
Protect our people!

520
00:39:23,800 --> 00:39:25,440
Defend our land!

521
00:39:25,520 --> 00:39:27,160
Protect our people!

522
00:39:39,920 --> 00:39:40,760
Princess.

523
00:39:42,600 --> 00:39:44,880
This is the detached palace
where you often lived as a child.

524
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:47,440
Do you remember it?

525
00:39:48,240 --> 00:39:49,600
I've seen it in dreams.

526
00:39:55,480 --> 00:39:58,160
Here are enshrined the spirit tablets
of Zhongwan's royal kin

527
00:39:58,240 --> 00:39:59,720
and loyal martyrs.

528
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:01,800
Every midnight,

529
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:04,680
you can hear them weeping.

530
00:40:05,360 --> 00:40:06,800
After Zhongwan fell,

531
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,720
Daning neglected this palace too.

532
00:40:10,360 --> 00:40:12,520
So we secretly established ourselves here.

533
00:40:12,600 --> 00:40:13,560
On the first night,

534
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:17,840
many of our people were driven mad
by phantom cries.

535
00:40:23,200 --> 00:40:24,040
Mr. Shangguan.

536
00:40:24,120 --> 00:40:26,000
The old clan chief
has been waiting for some time.
